    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2026.106304",
      "sequence": 11,
      "source_sequence": 11,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "Difference-in-differences with interference",
      "title_cn": "干扰的双重差异",
      "authors": [
        "Ruonan Xu"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "In many scenarios, such as the evaluation of place-based policies, potential outcomes are not only dependent upon the unit's own treatment but also its neighbors' treatment. Despite this,\"difference-in-differences\"(DID) type estimators typically ignore such interference among neighbors. I show in this paper that the canonical DID estimators generally fail to identify interesting causal effects in the presence of neighborhood interference. To incorporate interference structure into DID estimation, I propose doubly robust estimators for the direct average treatment effect on the treated as well as the average spillover effects under a modified parallel trends assumption. I later relax common restrictions in the literature, such as immediate neighborhood interference and correctly specified spillover functions. Moreover, robust inference is discussed based on the asymptotic distribution of the proposed estimators.",
      "abstract_cn": "在许多情况下，例如对基于地方的政策的评估，潜在的结果不仅取决于单位本身的待遇，还取决于其邻居的待遇。尽管如此，“双重差分”(DID)型估计器通常忽略邻居之间的这种干扰。我在本文中表明，在存在邻域干扰的情况下，规范的 DID 估计器通常无法识别有趣的因果效应。为了将干扰结构纳入 DID 估计中，我提出了双稳健估计器，用于对处理对象的直接平均处理效果以及修改后的平行趋势假设下的平均溢出效应。后来我放宽了文献中的常见限制，例如直接邻域干扰和正确指定的溢出函数。此外，基于所提出的估计量的渐近分布讨论了鲁棒推理。",
      "abstract_snippet_en": "",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jeconom.2026.106304",
